      "html": "<ul><li>Scientific name: Heptapterus mustelinus (Valenciennes, 1835)</li><li>Common name: Weasel Catfish</li><li>Type locality: Rio de la Plata, South America</li><li>Breeding: unreported</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1416",
      "html": "<p>South America: La Plata and Uruguay River basins and coastal drainages of southern Brazil.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1416",
      "html": "<ul><li>pH: 6.0–8.0</li><li>Temperature: 18–24°C</li><li>dH: 6–10</li></ul>"
